# scripts/opcount: `irframe bench ownlist N` calls a body that owns one
# value and writes its field in place N times (OWNED-LOCAL: the list form,
# v1.NewOwnerScope, Owning and OwningAt); the cost of one call is the slope
# between the two sizes. The control defers the value's close.
unit call
sizes 409600 2457600
args bench ownlist {n}
control benchmarks/frame/testdata/control
